    "single_arm_transfer_v1": {
      "description": "Single-arm object grasp/place with an explicit entry observe_scene node using reuse_current. The observation skill reuses a valid current capture or acquires a fresh capture through its normal version and feedback checks. Admit only an arm whose workspace contains BOTH the measured source and fixed release TCP; no handover or arm switch. Regenerate and replan once on the same arm. Empty grasp and placement uncertainty first use a fresh observation in place; return motion requires an explicit program evidence check. All effects and bounded recovery stay visible. Support regions use surface_setdown. Open containers use container_release at the configured TCP height above the measured rim. Gentle placement on a container floor is unsupported. For one specifically identified object use TaskSpec scope=ids and its exact target ref. For all/count, including count=1, call only after select_target and bind target_id=$selected; the template does not select a collection member.",
